.SS "const \fBPhysicsBody\fP NoPhysics\fR [static]\fP"

.PP
Shared absence object returned by \fBSprite\&.physics\fP and \fBPart\&.physics\fP until a body is created\&. Compare by identity to test for absence\&. Use removePhysicsBody() to restore the shared absence object\&. Valid mutating calls are ignored; they do not change the singleton or queue work for later body creation\&.

.PP
